                                                "sense_id": "1ceb64c4-7957-3f23-810c-26c59422e03e",
                                                "text": "[…] They told me that the Holy Rood had lean'd / And bow'd above me; […] / [I]f it bow'd, whether it symbol'd ruin / Or glory, who shall tell?"
                                            }
